# Accessibility screenshot tour (X-12): subtitles with their direction arrows above the chat log and the autosave
# spinner in the corner, then the same view in each colour-blind mode (the world filter; the HUD keeps its palette).
# Rendering required for images (headless runs only exercise the route):
#   godot --path . --rendering-driver vulkan -- --world=access-tour --size=tiny --new --player=tour --fresh-player \
#         --view=2 --graphics=medium --shots=/tmp/shots --smoke=res://game/Testing/Tours/access.cmds
wait_until player.frozen == 0 300
spawning off
town arrivals off
god on
camera third
time noon
weather clear
uiscale 1
aim 0 -0.15 1
wait 1
wait_until stream.idle == 1 900
access subtitles on
weather rain
wait 2
access hear npc_arrive
access hear hit_squish right
access hear boss_roar behind
save async
wait 0.3
assert ui.overlaps == 0
assert ui.saving == 1
assert ui.captions >= 4
screenshot access_01_captions
wait_until screenshot.pending == 0 900
# The one-shot lines and the spinner are timed and may have faded by the (settled) capture; rain's line stays.
assert ui.captions_weather >= 1
access subtitles off
weather clear
access colorblind deuteranopia
wait 0.3
screenshot access_02_deuteranopia
wait_until screenshot.pending == 0 900
access colorblind protanopia
wait 0.3
screenshot access_03_protanopia
wait_until screenshot.pending == 0 900
access colorblind tritanopia
wait 0.3
screenshot access_04_tritanopia
wait_until screenshot.pending == 0 900
access colorblind off
assert errors == 0
